
  # Forms in plain quotes         
                                  
  | #### Option B                 
  |                               
  | + Pros                        
  | • fits the current layout     
  |                               
  | − Cons                        
  | • reverses an earlier change  
                                  
  A plain quote with a quoted note
  and steps, one level deeper:    
                                  
  | Some context first.           
  |                               
  | | NOTE Before you start       
  | |                             
  | | Read the whole list.        
